<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2758133114"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1848023662"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="FIVE as ONE"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="RAISE A SUILEN"/><amll:meta key="album" value="'FIGHT' ADDICT"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:15.800"><div begin="00:03.449" end="04:03.790"><p begin="00:03.449" end="00:08.423" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">Flare, flare 燃え上がれ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽情闪耀 就此燃起烈焰</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Flare flare mo e a ga re</span></p><p begin="00:08.702" end="00:13.777" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">Flare, flare 空の果て<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽情闪耀 在天空尽头</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Flare flare so ra no ha te</span></p><p begin="00:13.787" end="00:28.299" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">Flare, flare 星は瞬く 僕らは行く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽情闪耀 繁星璀璨 我们将要启程</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Flare flare ho shi ha ma ta ta ku bo ku ra ha i ku</span></p><p begin="00:25.361" end="00:28.299" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">Ready? 進め 恐れることなく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">准备好了吗? 勇往直前 无所畏惧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Ready? su su me o so re ru ko to na ku</span></p><p begin="00:28.309" end="00:30.953" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">You can do it, You can do it.<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你一定可以成功 你一定可以成功</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">You can do it you can do it</span></p><p begin="00:31.513" end="00:36.737" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">Wow wo wow<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Wow wo wow</span></p><p begin="00:35.507" end="00:38.426" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">Ready? 進め 疑うことなく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">准备好了吗? 勇往直前 毫不怀疑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Ready? su su me u ta ga u ko to na ku</span></p><p begin="00:38.426" end="00:41.044" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">We can do it, We can do it.<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们一定能成功 我们一定能成功</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">We can do it we can do it</span></p><p begin="00:43.800" end="00:48.985" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">何を信じ 何を選び取り<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">该信奉什么 该作何抉择</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ni wo shi n ji na ni wo e ra bi to ri</span></p><p begin="00:49.285" end="00:53.885" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">如何に進み続けられるか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又要如何才能做到不懈前行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ka ni su su mi tsu du ke ra re ru ka</span></p><p begin="00:53.914" end="00:58.954" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">踏み出した 壁の向こう側へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">迈出步伐 跨越阻碍前路的壁垒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu mi da shi ta ka be no mu ko u ga wa he</span></p><p begin="00:59.304" end="01:04.233" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">Flare, flare 燃え上がれ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽情闪耀 就此燃起烈焰</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Flare flare mo e a ga re</span></p><p begin="01:04.243" end="01:09.166" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">Flare, flare 空の果て<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽情闪耀 在天空尽头</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Flare flare so ra no ha te</span></p><p begin="01:09.345" end="01:16.623" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">それぞれの目に映るのは 同じ夢<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">映入我们每个人眼中的则是同个梦想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re zo re no me ni u tsu ru no ha o na ji yu me</span></p><p begin="01:14.192" end="01:16.623" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">Ride or Die 声高らかに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">坚守到底 声音嘹亮响起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Ride or die ko e ta ka ra ka ni</span></p><p begin="01:16.633" end="01:19.172" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">Change the world 示す道筋<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">改变这个世界 昭示道路方向</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Change the world shi me su mi chi su ji</span></p><p begin="01:19.193" end="01:23.541" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">挑む 世界へ FIVE as ONE<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对世界发出挑战 五人同心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i do mu se ka i he five as one</span></p><p begin="01:22.857" end="01:26.074" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">信じている 僕たちを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">始终坚信我们自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi n ji te i ru bo ku ta chi wo</span></p><p begin="01:26.086" end="01:29.533" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">ただ それだけのことさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要能如此坚定不疑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta da so re da ke no ko to sa</span></p><p begin="01:29.543" end="01:33.338" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">必ずやり遂げると<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">必然会实现目标</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka na ra zu ya ri to ge ru to</span></p><p begin="01:33.348" end="01:36.132" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">振り向かなくてもWe know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便不回首遥望 我们也知道</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ri mu ka na ku te mo we know</span></p><p begin="01:36.142" end="01:39.639" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">今日も月が綺麗だ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今晚皎月仍旧美丽</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kyo u mo tsu ki ga ki re i da</span></p><p begin="01:39.649" end="01:47.403" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">Flare, flare 止まらずに行こう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽情闪耀 步履不停地前行下去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Flare flare to ma ra zu ni i ko u</span></p><p begin="01:54.603" end="01:59.664" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">果てしない夢に思えるか？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾经觉得梦想遥远无尽？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha te shi na i yu me ni o mo e ru ka ？</span></p><p begin="01:59.980" end="02:04.656" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">取るに足らない 他人の価値は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将旁人无足轻重的价值取向</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ru ni ta ra na i ta ni n no ka chi ha</span></p><p begin="02:04.666" end="02:09.837" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">嗤(わら)い声 全て蹴散らして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连同嘲笑 全都一脚踢散</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ra i go e su be te ke chi ra shi te</span></p><p begin="02:10.093" end="02:14.781" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">More and more 思うまま<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍旧渴望更多 忠于内心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">More and more o mo u ma ma</span></p><p begin="02:15.098" end="02:19.925" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">More and more 望むまま<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍旧渴望更多 追随渴望</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">More and more no zo mu ma ma</span></p><p begin="02:19.935" end="02:27.352" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">足を動かせ 鳴る鼓動は音楽へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">迈出脚步 让轰鸣心跳化作乐章</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a shi wo u go ka se na ru ko do u ha o n ga ku he</span></p><p begin="02:24.931" end="02:27.352" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">Fight the Fight 目に物見せる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">勇敢战斗下去 让世界为我们见证</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Fight the fight me ni mo no mi se ru</span></p><p begin="02:27.362" end="02:29.896" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">Change the world 底意地のステージ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">改变这个世界 踏上由衷渴望的舞台吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Change the world so ko i ji no su te e ji</span></p><p begin="02:29.906" end="02:34.128" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">歌え 世界へ FIVE as ONE<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对着世界歌唱吧 五人同心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ta e se ka i he five as one</span></p><p begin="02:33.645" end="02:36.839" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">信じている 僕たちを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">始终坚信我们自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi n ji te i ru bo ku ta chi wo</span></p><p begin="02:36.866" end="02:40.052" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">ただ それだけのことさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要能如此坚定不疑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta da so re da ke no ko to sa</span></p><p begin="02:40.381" end="02:44.178" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">不可能なんてないと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一切便皆有可能</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ka no u na n te na i to</span></p><p begin="02:44.189" end="02:46.909" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">満ち欠けを繰り返し<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">反复经历阴晴圆缺</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi chi ka ke wo ku ri ka e shi</span></p><p begin="02:46.919" end="02:50.170" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">時にはぶつかり合い<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有时也会发生碰撞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ki ni ha bu tsu ka ri a i</span></p><p begin="02:50.427" end="02:59.998" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">More and more 日々全て糧に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍旧渴望更多 将往昔岁月化作养分</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">More and more hi bi su be te ka te ni</span></p><p begin="02:56.945" end="02:59.998" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">Ready? 進め 恐れることなく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">准备好了吗? 勇往直前 无所畏惧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Ready? su su me o so re ru ko to na ku</span></p><p begin="03:00.008" end="03:02.574" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">You can do it, You can do it.<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你一定可以成功 你一定可以成功</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">You can do it you can do it</span></p><p begin="03:03.099" end="03:08.307" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">Wow wo wow<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Wow wo wow</span></p><p begin="03:07.063" end="03:10.007" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">Ready? 進め 疑うことなく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">准备好了吗? 勇往直前 毫不怀疑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Ready? su su me u ta ga u ko to na ku</span></p><p begin="03:10.017" end="03:12.621" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">We can do it, We can do it.<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们一定能成功 我们一定能成功</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">We can do it we can do it</span></p><p begin="03:14.119" end="03:19.202" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">信じている 僕たちを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">始终坚信我们自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi n ji te i ru bo ku ta chi wo</span></p><p begin="03:19.212" end="03:24.175" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">例え小さな輝きでも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕光芒仍旧渺小</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta to e chi i sa na ka ga ya ki de mo</span></p><p begin="03:24.185" end="03:27.327" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">歩みを止めない理由が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">步履不停的那个理由</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a yu mi wo to me na i ri yu u ga</span></p><p begin="03:27.350" end="03:35.609" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">絶えず胸を 焦がし続けるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">依然在源源不断地焦灼着内心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta e zu mu ne wo ko ga shi tsu du ke ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="03:35.619" end="03:37.432" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">FIVE as ONE<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">五人同心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Five as one</span></p><p begin="03:36.778" end="03:39.982" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">信じている 僕たちを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">始终坚信我们自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi n ji te i ru bo ku ta chi wo</span></p><p begin="03:40.011" end="03:43.179" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">ただ それだけのことさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要能如此坚定不疑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta da so re da ke no ko to sa</span></p><p begin="03:43.555" end="03:47.238" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">必ずやり遂げると<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">必然会实现目标</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka na ra zu ya ri to ge ru to</span></p><p begin="03:47.248" end="03:50.036" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">振り向かなくてもWe know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便不回首遥望 我们也知道</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ri mu ka na ku te mo we know</span></p><p begin="03:50.092" end="03:53.571" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">今日も月が綺麗だ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今晚皎月仍旧美丽</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kyo u mo tsu ki ga ki re i da</span></p><p begin="03:53.581" end="04:03.790" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">Flare, flare 止まらずに行こう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽情闪耀 步履不停地前行下去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Flare flare to ma ra zu ni i ko u</span></p></div></body></tt>